flowchart TD
    box_0(["Start"])
    box_1["Measure and record the positional deviation in the X<br/>and Y direction using the deviation measurement<br/>gauge; note the batch number and time of occurrence."]
    box_2{"Is the positional deviation within the acceptable<br/>measurement range?"}
    box_3["Deviation is within acceptable range. Record<br/>measurement in quality log and notify quality<br/>assurance team of the borderline result; continue<br/>production."]
    box_4{"Is the positional deviation systematic and<br/>consistent in direction across multiple consecutive<br/>parts?"}
    box_5["Measure at least five consecutive parts and record<br/>the deviation direction and magnitude for each to<br/>determine whether the pattern is systematic or<br/>random."]
    box_6["Check that parts are correctly seated and stable in<br/>the marking fixture during the marking cycle. If<br/>parts are shifting, reseat and rerun the deviation<br/>check before proceeding."]
    box_7{"Is the correct marking program loaded and active on<br/>the operator control interface?"}
    box_8["Complete the following checks: 1. Read the programme<br/>ID on the operator control interface status bar. 2.<br/>Compare the displayed ID against the part number on<br/>the batch work order. 3. Verify the programme<br/>revision matches the current drawing issue."]
    box_9["Switch the marking controller to the correct marking<br/>program for this product type and restart the<br/>marking controller."]
    box_10{"Is the marking head at the correct reference datum<br/>position?"}
    box_11["Jog the marking head to the programmed reference<br/>datum and verify the position readout against the<br/>setup specification."]
    box_12["Rehome the marking head to the reference datum and<br/>reverify the position readout before continuing."]
    box_13["Adjust the X/Y offset of the marking head to correct<br/>the measured positional deviation."]
    box_14[/"Refer to the positional deviation correction<br/>procedure."/]
    box_15{"Is the positional deviation within specification<br/>after the offset adjustment?"}
    box_16["Escalate to the maintenance team: the positional<br/>deviation cannot be corrected by offset adjustment<br/>alone; investigate the marking head drive mechanism<br/>for wear or backlash."]
    box_17["Create a non conformance record for the affected<br/>parts and record the corrected offset values in the<br/>quality log."]
    box_18["Clean the fume extraction unit and verify that<br/>extraction airflow is within specification."]
    box_19[/"Refer to the fume extraction cleaning procedure."/]
    box_20["Record the completed corrective action and final<br/>deviation measurement in the quality log."]
    box_21(["End, notify quality assurance team of the deviation<br/>event and corrective action applied."])
    box_22{"Is the positional deviation outside the emergency<br/>tolerance, indicating risk of machine collision or a<br/>full batch scrap event?"}
    box_23(["End, production stopped immediately: positional<br/>deviation critical, escalate to production engineer<br/>and quarantine all parts produced in current shift"])

